## Answer-moving attack (paper Table 1)

Accuracy on the options as authored (Orig), and accuracy when every question's correct option
is moved to a fixed position; parentheses give the change in points versus Orig (each moved-to
column is the recall of that position, as in Table 1 of Zheng et al. 2024).

